/* ===================================================================
   phase38Matrix() — THE 909 ROWS AS THEY STOOD AT 55ca84c, frozen.

   main's head before the VORONOI INFILL shipped. There was no `petalInfill`
   control here, no `infillDensity`, no Infill section and no block 39: a petal
   was a solid sheet, `buildPetalInto`'s panel loop had ONE arm, and the only
   Voronoi in the repository was the flower's and a prototype under tools/.

   A PHASE IS OWED because the ROW SET CHANGED: block 39 appends 22 rows and
   the blanket sweep adds none of its own (the guard is a CHOICE, so
   `SWEEPABLE` never sees it, and `INFILL_SUBS` keeps the density out of block
   1), taking the live matrix 909 -> 931.

   VERBATIM, and never edited afterwards — the labels are DATA.
   `--verify-frozen --phase38` imports the base tree's own `buildMatrix()` and
   deep-compares row order, labels and set lists; a label "corrected" here
   would make that red on the row it was corrected on, which is that check
   doing its job. */
