/* ===================================================================
   phase51Matrix() — THE 1080 ROWS AS THEY STOOD AT af15342, frozen.

   main's head before NODES DECOUPLED FROM LEAVES (Eva's ruling 6, stem
   session 2): a stem with no leaves carried no nodes, and block 41's
   `GATED — prominence 1 with no leaves` row was genuinely inert. A PHASE IS
   OWED: that session relabels that row in the live matrix (its label became
   false) and appends block 47 (bare-stem nodes), which changes the ROW SET.
   It is 51 and not 50 because the INFLORESCENCE NODE LAWS (#353) took
   phase50 and block 46 while this session was in CI. Generated from that base
   commit's own `buildMatrix()`; the labels are verbatim — never edit a label
   here.
   =================================================================== */
